{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12d0_level_act12d0_01_end",
  "groupId": "act12d0",
  "stageId": "act12d0_01",
  "title": "高空墜物",
  "storyCode": "RI-1",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "9cfd538aaf50aeeb9b1065b7dd70d1d32c088827d40d034638f8cc8c2c7ff1e5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*粗話*，好、好厲害。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，你們還挺厲害的嘛，可惜撞上了我嘉維爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等、等等，你說你叫什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仔細一看，這張臉，這頭髮，你不是嘉維爾嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是說了我是嘉維爾嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噫，是嘉維爾，嘉維爾回來了！弟兄們，走，快去告訴森蚺族長！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？森蚺？喂，給我等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，跑掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，你們再來晚一點，我就要被它們搶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "駕駛的傢伙呢，叫什麼來著，哦對，迪倫，迪倫呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "迪倫剛才想要反抗這群阿達克利斯人被他們打昏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，嘉維爾，迪倫在這裡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，把他拖過來吧，我來看看傷勢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，Lancet-2，你應該會修這個飛行器吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，在出發前，可露希爾為我錄入了大量飛行器相關的知識。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原本在成功迫降後，依靠維修工具應該是能完成維修的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小刻，我讓你把他拖過來，不是讓你真的用拖的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，對不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......看起來對面也沒下死手，嗯？看不出來，這傢伙內褲挺花哨......咳，估計躺半天就自己醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，Lancet-2，你說什麼但是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是剛才那群阿達克利斯人，把引擎搶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？引擎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，在他們發現我之前，我在艙內看到他們首先找到了飛行器的引擎並直接把它拆了下來並帶走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們來看這邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_aircraft_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔，真的有個洞欸。雖然我不太懂這東西，不過應該是飛不起來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，飛不起來了呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？博士，你的臉色不太好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這下麻煩了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "要被凱爾希殺了！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一段時間以前"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，從我老家寄來的，家鄉那邊又要舉行“瑪維索提亞”了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“瑪維索提亞”，力量與榮耀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這你都知道？這是我老家選舉大酋長的祭典用的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經有相當一段時間沒有聽人使用這種語言了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過，我記得你是背井離鄉來到羅德島的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，不過還有一個小妹妹和我有聯絡，這封信就是她寄來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我記得你說過，你是因為被排擠而離開的，那麼選舉酋長應當與你無關。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，我也不是回去做大酋長的，只是小姑娘好像很想讓我回去的樣子，我也有確實有一陣子沒有回去了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想家了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有一點吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，為什麼要帶上Dr.{@nickname}，從生物學的角度來說，他沒有其實是你同族的可能性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士也努力了這麼久，我想著帶他去放鬆一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼飛行器使用申請書又是怎麼回事，煌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是因為嘉維爾老家在薩爾貢的無人區，靠走的實在太遠了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以冒著被薩爾貢官方發現的風險，你們想要用近地飛行器代步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，不是！我們看過地圖了，嘉維爾的老家在薩爾貢境內的一片巨大無人區，從我們搜集的情報來看，薩爾貢官方在那裡沒有安插任何力量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那一片區域確實只在名義上屬於薩爾貢的國土，功課做得不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那麼，既然你們都計畫好了，還來問我幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因、因為申請書要過您的手......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "行不行啊，凱爾希，不行就算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）博士，要不還是算了，凱爾希肯定不會同意的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可以，我批准了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的嗎？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你從沒好好向我們介紹過你的家鄉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而作為羅德島不可或缺的一員，既然你主動提出，我認為為此付出一次Dr.{@nickname}和一名精英幹員的假期不算什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "煌",
      "speakerId": "char_017_homura",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，我會把這次行動視作一次實地考察，你們可以自由挑選空閒的幹員。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米婭最近很忙，如果她想去，我不會允許，你自己去告訴她這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那裡無論如何依然是薩爾貢的境內，羅德島在薩爾貢設立的辦事處很少，不要引起不必要的麻煩，無論是對你的，還是對羅德島的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，近地飛行器即使在羅德島也是非常珍貴的交通工具。薩爾貢境內環境惡劣，希望你能完好無損地把它帶回來，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，這麼一說，確實有這麼一回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，別緊張，博士，這裡是我老家，我熟得很。Lancet-2，只要找到剛才那群人，把引擎搶回來就行了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......對方似乎懂一些機械技術，引擎被拆卸的過程中沒有對其他部分造成很大破壞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能找到引擎的話，我應該能夠指導各位把它裝回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，現在我需要做一些緊急維護防止它爆炸，大家請等我一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？懂機械？我以前可沒聽說過有這樣的人，我們都是用拳頭說話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖說是懂機械，其實也只是學會了拔管道和插線而已啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......哦，不對，既然是她的手下......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，我餓了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飛行器上的食物儲備應該沒有出問題吧?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，應該是沒有問題的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是迫降過程中有些功能損壞了，現在儲藏室是封閉的，我需要一些時間來重新解鎖它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那小刻你再等一等。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是我現在好餓！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，那我們先......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉——維——爾——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這個聲音......糟了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，是嘉維爾，真的是嘉維爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你留了長髮！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你的衣服好好看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你怎麼拿了武器，而且這把武器看起來不像打人的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，特米米，是我沒錯，總之，你先鬆開我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你在外面吃得好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你真的成為醫生了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唉，你怎麼在這裡，特米米？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個，我看到天上有個東西掉下來，就過來看一看，結果就看到你了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你的病治好了嗎？我看書上說外面對得了石頭病的人很不好，你沒事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事沒事，我好得很。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，你可算回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_070",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看到你沒事我就放心了啊，嘉維爾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "果然還是要你來當大酋長才行啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做夢去吧，我只是請假回來看看的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "嘉維爾，你不是說你是被排擠才離開家鄉？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘉維爾，這、這個人是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？特米米，你說的是薩爾貢語？還挺流利的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，為了能和嘉維爾交流，我特地學的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，這樣以後我就用薩爾貢語和你寫信好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嘉維爾，所以這些人都是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，這個人是Dr.{@nickname}，你可以叫博士，應該算作我的上司吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其他人嘛，都算是我的同事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上司......難道你比嘉維爾還要厲害？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "沒有。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "那你為什麼會是嘉維爾的上司呢？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嘉維爾，這個人看上去很弱的樣子。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "我比嘉維爾厲害多了！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "特米米",
              "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "不可能！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起這個，特米米，我們飛行器在墜毀後引擎被搶了，是祖瑪瑪的人，她現在也有手下了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "飛行器引擎是什麼呀，和那些發動機什麼的一樣嗎？等下......欸？祖瑪瑪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，嗯，祖瑪瑪她現在是一個部族的酋長呢，這次大酋長很多人都覺得肯定是她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喔——這麼說的話，說不定把我們轟下來的也是他們呢，也只有那傢伙會鑽研各種奇奇怪怪的武器了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯，嗯！如果你要找祖瑪瑪的話，祭典明天就要開始了，所有想要競爭酋長的人都在向神廟聚集，祖瑪瑪一定也會去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也就是說去那裡就能找到她嗎，哈，好極了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且你這丫頭不也說想要競爭酋長，就讓我看看你這幾年有什麼長進吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小聲）其實我還是想讓嘉維爾你當酋長啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒、沒什麼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，緊急維護已經完成了，我們要出發了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦你了，Lancet-2，沒錯，接下來我們要去神廟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇啊！機器說話了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然有過心理準備，但總是這樣的反應還是稍微有些傷人呢，雖然我不是人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在飛行器不會爆炸了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，但是就這樣把它晾在這裡也不是辦法呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這倒也是，我可不想被凱爾希瞪眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那、那個，我可以分出我的人把它拖回我的部族去，這樣你們應該放心了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的部族？嗯？這麼說來，剛才都沒發現，你這丫頭，難道也成了一個族長？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯！其實就是嘉維爾以前的部族哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，難怪我看到幾個熟面孔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，嘉維爾，現在部族改名了哦，從“荒野意志”改名叫“嘉維爾意志”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我們都覺得嘉維爾是最棒的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，咳咳，總之，那就交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小的們，聽到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，這樣的話，我和迪倫先生一起跟著飛行器好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來博士你們似乎要去人很多的地方，感覺我一起去會很麻煩呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且飛行器也需要有人維護。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啥，你不去看祭典嗎？可好看了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒關係的，我也更加喜歡安靜一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧，既然這樣，那就只有我和博士還有小刻去祭典了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特米米",
      "speakerId": "char_411_tomimi",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "還有我！我也帶一些小弟和你一起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "出發！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
              "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "等一等，博士，小刻呢？"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "博士，你怎麼了？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "嗯？等等，小刻哪兒去了？！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "小刻呢？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
              "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
              "isRemote": false,
              "text": "咦，對啊，剛才還在的，這孩子跑哪兒去了？"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿達克利斯人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_071",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們說的小刻，難道是那邊那個有點神叨叨的傢伙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會讓你們傷害博士的，整合運動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "刻俄柏",
      "speakerId": "char_2013_cerber",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咿呀！竟敢搶我的蜜餅！不要跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_desert_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小刻一個人在那裡和空氣戰鬥的樣子......唔，這難道是中毒導致的錯覺？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦！完蛋！忘記說了！這一帶路邊有不少野生的蘑菇和果實，裡面大半是不能吃的，吃了就會變成那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘了這孩子比我還野，大概是趁我們聊天的時候出去轉了一圈吃掉的吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "嘉維爾",
      "speakerId": "char_187_ccheal",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，總之，把她綁起來，Lancet-2你們一起帶回去吧，過一陣子應該就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "交給我吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Lancet-2",
      "speakerId": "char_285_medic2",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以及，友情提醒，周邊的氣溫比較高，而且這種環境通常晝夜溫差較大，不要忘記帶足補給哦。"
    },
